    "noteZh": "页面最顶一条橙色横幅写着 “v3 is stable. See what changed”，导航是 Guide、한국어 和三档版本 1.x / 2.x / 3.x。首屏左半是标题 React Native Gesture Image Viewer 加一行 Smooth and flexible viewer，一副 “Reanimated-powered image gestures with full control”，两个按钮 Quick Start 与 GitHub；按钮下面一排包管理器标签 npm、yarn、pnpm、bun、deno，给出命令 npm install react-native-gesture-image-viewer。正文的九张卡片按 Complete Gesture Support、External Control API、Multi-Instance Management 这样铺开，页面开头还专门给 AI agent 指了 /llms.txt 与 /llms-full.txt 两个文档索引。",
